From: Icesito <113939920+Icesito68@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:54:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] =?UTF-8?q?r9q:=20shim=20de=20libhidlbase=20para=20e?=
 =?UTF-8?q?l=20postproc=20de=20c=C3=A1mara?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Se carga dentro del proveedor con el pool de binder ya iniciado y la
libhidlbase de Android 16 aborta al reconfigurarlo.
Change-Id: Ic8f6ad008e0d9fc8693a889316928abdcbb4e9ea
---
 extract-files.py | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/extract-files.py b/extract-files.py
index 9c86194..4a264c8 100755
--- a/extract-files.py
+++ b/extract-files.py
@@ -33,6 +33,12 @@ blob_fixups: blob_fixups_user_type = {
     # android::base::Trim(const std::string&) ya no existe en la libbase de Android 16
     'vendor/lib64/nfc_nci_nxpsn.so': blob_fixup()
         .add_needed('libbase_shim.so'),
+    # Se carga dentro del proveedor de cámara con el pool de binder ya en marcha y
+    # la libhidlbase de Android 16 aborta ("Binder threadpool cannot be shrunk")
+    'vendor/lib64/vendor.qti.hardware.camera.postproc@1.0-service-impl.so': blob_fixup()
+        .add_needed('libhidlbase_shim_sm8350.so')
+        .binary_regex_replace(b'_ZN7android8hardware22configureRpcThreadpoolEmb',
+                              b'_ZN7android8hardware22configureRpcTh_pathcedEmb'),
     'vendor/lib64/hw/camera.qcom.so': blob_fixup()
         .binary_regex_replace(b'ro.boot.flash.locked', b'ro.camera.notify_nfc'),
     'vendor/lib64/hw/com.qti.chi.override.so': blob_fixup()
